msgstr "Seatmap Connect"

#: includes/class-seatmap-settings.php:126
msgid "Connect this store to your Seatmap account. Seats, prices and availability come from Seatmap; the cart, payment and refunds stay here in WooCommerce."
msgstr "Reliez cette boutique à votre compte Seatmap. Les places, les prix et la disponibilité viennent de Seatmap ; le panier, le paiement et les remboursements restent ici, dans WooCommerce."

#: includes/class-seatmap-settings.php:132
msgid "API URL"
msgstr "URL de l’API"

